# Files packwiz must not index or export.
# Third-party JARs and archives are never committed; packwiz references them by URL
# and hash, so a stray downloaded file here would be both redundant and a licensing
# problem for redistribution.
*.jar
*.zip
*.mrpack

# Local runtime state that a launcher or server produces inside an instance.
saves/
logs/
crash-reports/
screenshots/
.fabric/
